    <bpmn:process id="W_W1701" name="W1701. Revaluation of Fixed Assets" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Management decision to adopt revaluation model (vs. cost model) for a class of assets; or significant and sustained change in fair value
Frequency: Event-driven; if revaluation model adopted, typically every 3–5 years or when material change occurs
Volume: Rare — only if BuildRight elects revaluation model for land or buildings
Owner: CFO
Participants: CFO, Fixed Asset Accountant, External Appraiser, External Auditor
Source: workflow W1701 — Revaluation of Fixed Assets</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1701_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1701_Lane1" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1701_Lane2" name="External Appraiser">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1701_Lane3" name="Fixed Asset Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1701_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1701_Start5" name="Management decision to adopt revaluation model (vs. cost model) for a class of assets; or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1701_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1701_Task6" name="CFO determines if revaluation model is appropriate: (a) typically applied to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO determines if revaluation model is appropriate: (a) typically applied to land and buildings where fair value is reliably measurable, (b) revaluation model requires regular revaluation of entire asset class (not individual assets), (c) cost model (most common in Philippine retail) is default — no revaluation needed
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Strategic decision</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1701_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1701_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1701_Task7" name="If revaluation adopted: engage accredited external appraiser to determine fair…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: If revaluation adopted: engage accredited external appraiser to determine fair value of asset class (e.g., all store properties, all land); appraiser provides valuation report with methodology, assumptions, and fair value conclusions
Responsible (R): External Appraiser
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1701_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1701_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1701_Task8" name="Fixed Asset Accountant records revaluation adjustment: (a) if fair value &gt;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Fixed Asset Accountant records revaluation adjustment: (a) if fair value &gt; carrying amount: credit revaluation surplus (equity, other comprehensive income), (b) if fair value &lt; carrying amount: debit revaluation loss (P&amp;L, to extent of prior surplus), (c) depreciation recalculated on revalued amount over remaining useful life
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1701_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1701_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1701_Task9" name="Ongoing: revaluation must be kept sufficiently current; if asset class is…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Ongoing: revaluation must be kept sufficiently current; if asset class is revalued, all assets in that class must be revalued simultaneously
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Every 3–5 years</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1701_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1701_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1701_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1701_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
