        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-347 (ensure controlled execution — Depreciation &amp; Financial Reporting (PA-35.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
