    <bpmn:process id="W_W1702" name="W1702. Fixed Asset Register Reconciliation &amp; Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Month-end close; annual audit preparation
Frequency: Monthly reconciliation; quarterly detailed review
Volume: 5 entity registers + 1 consolidated register
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant
Participants: Fixed Asset Accountant, GL Accountant, Accounting Manager
Source: workflow W1702 — Fixed Asset Register Reconciliation &amp; Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1702_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1702_Lane1" name="Fixed Asset Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1702_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1702_Lane3" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1702_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1702_Start5" name="Month-end close; annual audit preparation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1702_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1702_Task6" name="Monthly: Fixed Asset Accountant reconciles fixed asset sub-ledger to GL: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: Fixed Asset Accountant reconciles fixed asset sub-ledger to GL: (a) total gross asset value in sub-ledger = GL fixed asset control accounts, (b) total accumulated depreciation in sub-ledger = GL accumulated depreciation accounts, (c) net book value reconciliation: gross − accumulated depreciation = net book value per GL, (d) identify and resolve discrepancies (timing differences, unposted entries, manual adjustments)
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1702_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1702_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1702_Task7" name="System generates monthly fixed asset roll-forward report: (a) opening balance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System generates monthly fixed asset roll-forward report: (a) opening balance (gross and accumulated depreciation), (b) additions (new assets), (c) disposals (retired assets), (d) depreciation expense for the month, (e) impairment losses, (f) transfers (inter-entity/inter-location), (g) foreign currency translation adjustments (if any), (h) closing balance (gross and accumulated depreciation)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Fixed Asset Accountant
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1702_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1702_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1702_Task8" name="Accounting Manager reviews roll-forward for unusual movements: (a) large…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Accounting Manager reviews roll-forward for unusual movements: (a) large additions not matching approved capex list, (b) disposals without proper authorization, (c) depreciation spikes from useful life changes, (d) inter-entity transfer imbalances
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 hour/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1702_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1702_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1702_Task9" name="Quarterly: Fixed Asset Accountant prepares fixed asset summary for CFO: (a) net…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Quarterly: Fixed Asset Accountant prepares fixed asset summary for CFO: (a) net book value by entity and asset category, (b) capital expenditure vs. budget, (c) depreciation expense vs. budget, (d) disposals and gains/losses on disposal, (e) key metrics: average age of assets by category, asset turnover ratio (revenue ÷ net fixed assets)
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1702_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1702_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1702_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1702_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1702_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-347 (ensure controlled execution — Depreciation &amp; Financial Reporting (PA-35.2).) | - operational: Fixed Asset Accountant review and approval gate; periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
